.TH "BDREADER" "1" "June 29, 2014" "Vincent Crocher"
.SH NAME
bdreader \- An e-comics reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bdreader
[
.I comics_file
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBBDReader\fR is a graphical e-comics reader featuring an auto-panel
detection. BDReader can open PDF files, comics archives (CBZ, CBR, CBT, 
CB7), image archives (RAR, ZIP, TAR, 7Z) and image folders.
.SH FILES
\fBBDReader\fR creates a .bdreader directory in the user's home. This directory 
contains the user's preference files. To reset the preferences to their initial 
state, remove the files contained in the .bdreader directory. 
